==============================================================================
T15 NHANES 1999-2002 — blinded prospective cohort test
==============================================================================

Design: samples drawn 1999-2002 with no knowledge of cancer outcomes.
        NDI mortality linkage through 2019-12-31 gives up to 20 years
        of prospective follow-up. 271 cancer deaths.

Metric: GrimAge acceleration (+ ancillary clocks) as the closest
        publicly-computable proxy for the framework's A-score.
        Raw Xu-538 panel requires NCHS-RDC DUA application.

DNMEPI loaded: 4449 rows × 32 cols
  with PhenoAge non-null: 2532

==============================================================================
  Cohort size (eligstat=1, DNMEPI non-null, fu_years non-null): n = 2532
  All-cause deaths:  1361 (53.8%)
  Cancer deaths:     271 (10.7%)
  Median follow-up:  17.1 yr  (max: 20.8)
  Median age at draw: 65.0 yr
==============================================================================

